  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Emergency Preparedness &amp; Access to Inclusive Recovery Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the financial preparedness of vulnerable governments, firms and households against climate shocks in participating countries. The first phase of the program would focus on Mozambique, Madagascar and Comoros. Malawi and Lesotho may also join the first phase.</narrative>
  </description>
